    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><p><span>欢迎大家收听由Mint Ventures发起的播客【 WEB3 Mint To Be 】</span></p></blockquote><p><span>本期我们请研究员 Lawrence 来做一下关于 AI 算力互联层及相关重点标的的分享。他会讲到算力互联的架构、光模块的传递、CPO 渗透率预测等内容，还会重点拆解 Lumentum（音频中简称 LITE） 和 Coherent 两个公司的业务情况和风险点。希望能让你有所收获。</span></p><p><span>欢迎留言，写下你的观点，也可写下其他你希望我们关注、讨论的投资标的。</span></p><blockquote><p><span>时间线:</span></p></blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">00:02:30</a> 算力互联的四层架构</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="295">00:04:55</a>关于「光进铜退」</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="456">00:07:36</a> 光模块的传递拆解</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">00:09:00</a> 激光器的难度分层</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="742">00:12:22</a> 激光器的”租金池”方程</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="801">00:13:21</a> 模块层面的四种变化</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="929">00:15:29</a> CPO 渗透率预测</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1432">00:23:52</a> 两个标的的业务数据和风险拆解</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2029">00:33:49</a> 总结</span></p><p><span>文字版：</span><a href="https://research.mintventures.fund/2026/08/11/web3-mint-to-be-ep43-a-brief-look-at-the-ai-compute-interconnect-layer-why-lumentum-and-coherent/" data-url="https://research.mintventures.fund/2026/08/11/web3-mint-to-be-ep43-a-brief-look-at-the-ai-compute-interconnect-layer-why-lumentum-and-coherent/"><span>《EP43：AI 算力互联层浅析：为什么选择 Lumentum 和 Coherent》</span></a></p>]]></description>
